A line comment hides a substitution arrow

```
{~a %% b~>c~} d
.
<p>{~a d</p>
```

```
{~alpha %% hidden~>word~} tail
.
<p>{~alpha tail</p>
```

```
{~a~>b %% c~} d
.
<p><del>a</del><ins>b</ins> d</p>
```

```
x{+"q"+}
.
<p>x<ins>“q”</ins></p>
```

```
2{+--x+}
.
<p>2<ins>--x</ins></p>
```

```
x:foo["q"]
.
<p>x<span class="ext-foo">“q”</span></p>
```

```
!`(`"q"
.
<p>(”q”</p>
```

```
`(`{=html}"q"
.
<p>(”q”</p>
```

```
{~a %% b~>c
~>d~}
.
<p><del>a
</del><ins>d</ins></p>
```
